{"seq":78,"slug":"functional-reactive-programming","title":"函数式响应编程","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming","rating":{"composite":4,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"函数式响应编程\">函数式响应编程</h1><p>函数式响应编程（Functional Reactive Programming，FRP）是一种将<strong>函数式编程</strong>与<strong>响应式数据流</strong>相结合的编程范式，用于声明式地处理随时间变化的值和异步事件序列。与传统命令式代码&quot;主动轮询状态&quot;不同，FRP 将程序构建为数据流的变换图——数据变化时自动向下游传播，计算逻辑在图上静态声明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的位置\">本 hub 的位置</h2><p>本 hub 聚焦<strong>FRP 范式的理论、规范与主流实现</strong>，回答&quot;什么是流、为什么需要流、如何正确使用流&quot;这三个核心问题。覆盖范围从 Conal Elliott 的原始形式化定义，到工业界广泛使用的 RxJS/Reactor/Combine/Kotlin Flow，再到背压、错误处理、测试等生产关键模式，最终落到 UI 响应式绑定和后端事件驱动系统两个主要应用领域。</p>\n<p><strong>与兄弟 hub 的边界：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的区别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>05_functional-programming</code></td>\n<td>λ 演算、纯函数、不可变性、Monad</td>\n<td>FP 基础理论，本 hub 在其上添加&quot;时间维度&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>14_concurrency-models</code></td>\n<td>线程/协程/Actor 并发模型</td>\n<td>并发执行机制；FRP 是数据流声明而非并发原语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>01_typescript</code></td>\n<td>TypeScript 类型系统与语言特性</td>\n<td>语言本身；RxJS/Operators 是 TS 生态中的 FRP 实现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本 hub 不重复讲解函数式基础（map/filter/reduce），不涉及低层线程调度，也不做 TypeScript 语言入门。读者应具备基本函数式思维和异步编程经验（3 年以上工程背景）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节导览\">章节导览</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>FRP 基础</strong> — 从 Conal Elliott 的连续时间语义出发，建立 Signal/Behavior/Event 的精确模型，并覆盖 Reactive Streams 规范（Publisher/Subscriber/Subscription/Processor + 背压协议）</li>\n<li><strong>语言实现</strong> — RxJS Observable 与操作符体系、Project Reactor（Mono/Flux）、Apple Combine 与 Kotlin Flow 的异同</li>\n<li><strong>编程模式</strong> — 背压策略（buffer/drop/latest/request-based）、onErrorResume/retry/circuit-breaker 错误处理、StepVerifier/marble testing 响应式测试</li>\n<li><strong>应用场景</strong> — MVVM + 响应式绑定/单向数据流、WebFlux/R2DBC 后端系统、Kafka Streams/Flink 事件驱动数据管线</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><code>05_functional-programming</code> — 纯函数、Monad、函数组合的理论基础</li>\n<li><code>14_concurrency-models</code> — 协程与 Actor 等并发执行模型，与 FRP 结合使用的场景</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"FRP 基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"frp-core-concepts","title":"FRP 核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/foundations/frp-core-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"signals-behaviors-events","title":"信号、行为与事件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/foundations/signals-behaviors-events"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reactive-streams-spec","title":"Reactive Streams 规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/foundations/reactive-streams-spec"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"implementations","title":"语言实现","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/implementations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rxjs-observable","title":"RxJS 与 Observable","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/implementations/rxjs-observable"},{"seq":2,"slug":"project-reactor","title":"Project Reactor：响应式 JVM 编程库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/implementations/project-reactor"},{"seq":3,"slug":"combine-kotlin-flow","title":"Combine 与 Kotlin Flow","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/implementations/combine-kotlin-flow"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"patterns","title":"编程模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"backpressure-strategies","title":"背压策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/patterns/backpressure-strategies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"error-handling-resilience","title":"错误处理与容错","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/patterns/error-handling-resilience"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reactive-testing-debugging","title":"响应式测试与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/patterns/reactive-testing-debugging"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"应用场景","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reactive-ui-patterns","title":"响应式 UI 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/applications/reactive-ui-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reactive-backend-systems","title":"响应式后端系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/applications/reactive-backend-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"event-driven-data-pipelines","title":"事件驱动数据管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/applications/event-driven-data-pipelines"}]}]}